       fhir:l <http://hl7.org/fhir/tools/StructureDefinition/profile-summary>
     ] ;
     fhir:value [
       a fhir:String ;
       fhir:v "#### Summary of the Mandatory Requirements\r\r1.  One instance of `Observation.code.coding` which must have\r    -   a fixed `Observation.code.coding.system` = **'http://loinc.org'**\r    -   a fixed  `Observation.code.coding.code` = **'85353-1'**\r    -   additional Coding repetitions representing a more specific code for the measurement obtained MAY be included in `Observation.code`.\r1.  A fixed `Observation.organizer` = **'true'**\r1.  No value in `Observation.value[x]`\r1.  A minimum of two Vitals Sign Observation references in `Observation.hasMember` (a \"panel\" is always expected to have more than one member observation)"
     ]
  ] ) ; # 
